<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Synthesia H1 gross profit falls.</title>
<headline>Czech Synthesia H1 gross profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six month period</p>
<p>ending June 30, 1996: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit	 45.030	 vs	 255.639</p>
<p> Total sales     2,866.100	 vs     3,241.500</p>
<p> Production	2,736.800	 vs     3,129.200</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Synthesia a.s.. The firm is a chemicals, paints and explosives maker. Synthesia shares are traded on the main market of the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
